DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The BBUUSS__RREESSCCAANN() method is called to request a rescan of the child de‐
     vices on a bus device.  The method should add any devices that have been
     added since the previous scan and remove devices that have been removed.
     This method is not required to re-examine existing devices to determine
     if their properties have changed.  This method is also not required to
     propagate the rescan request to child devices.

